 "remarks": "Your Rowayton Vision: Capture the opportunity to build the custom home you've been envisioning on approximately 0.39 acres in Rowayton. The land has been surveyed and staked, and the property has no wetlands. Preliminary architectural review indicates the lot may support a 5,000 sq ft house and pool, subject to all applicable municipal approvals. The private, south-facing backyard promises sun-filled outdoor living. This is the rare chance to shape every room around the way you live, in one of Fairfield County's most cherished coastal villages. Bayley Beach, the Friday Farmers Market, and Rowayton's shops and waterfront restaurants are just moments away. Rowayton's community calendar stays full year-round, from summer concerts at the beach, Porch Fest, and the River Ramble to July 4th Fireworks, the Turkey Trot, and the Holiday Stroll. Rowayton Metro-North Station is nearby, and NYC is about 1 hour away. Bring your architect. Design, build, and settle into coastal Rowayton life.",
